WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.720
Switch it off to those burpees. Nice full push-up.

2
00:00:03.720 --> 00:00:08.320
Hard jump at the top every single time. Just push yourself as hard as possible.

3
00:00:08.320 --> 00:00:11.720
You want to be dead by the time you're done. Almost done. Couple more seconds.

4
00:00:11.720 --> 00:00:16.100
Into those jumping jacks. Keep those arms and legs really nice and straight.

5
00:00:16.100 --> 00:00:18.960
Contracting all those muscles through your arms, chest, and legs.

6
00:00:18.960 --> 00:00:22.800
Making sure you're burning as many calories as you possibly can.

7
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:28.080
And let it relax. Alright, very good job. We are completely done with this routine.

8
00:00:28.480 --> 00:00:32.320
Now if you push anywhere near as hard as I did, then you're going to feel this tomorrow.

9
00:00:32.320 --> 00:00:36.080
So make sure you do a really good cool-down and stretch, and you drink plenty of water today.
